{"id":64,"title":"Kochi Water Metro to add four routes and 15 boats by next year","subheadline":"The expansion links Fort Kochi, Mattancherry and three island communities to the network","url":"/kochi/demo-all-blocks-kochi-water-metro-expansion","full_url":"__PREVIEW_SITE__/kochi/demo-all-blocks-kochi-water-metro-expansion","image":{"id":142,"alt":"Illustrative stock photo","width":1600,"height":900,"thumbnail":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-32.2e16d0ba.fill-400x225.format-webp.webp","width":400,"height":225},"card":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-32.2e16d0ba.fill-800x450.format-webp.webp","width":800,"height":450}},"primary_category":{"id":22,"name":"Kochi","slug":"kochi","colour":"#2E7D32","url":"/kochi"},"reporter":{"name":"Rahul Nair","slug":"rahul-nair","url":"/reporter/rahul-nair"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T15:19:19.154098+05:30","last_major_update_at":null,"reading_time":2,"language":"en","flags":{"is_breaking":false,"is_premium":false,"has_video":false},"hero_image":{"id":142,"alt":"Illustrative stock photo","width":1600,"height":900,"hero":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-32.2e16d0ba.fill-1600x900.format-webp.webp","width":1600,"height":900},"card":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-32.2e16d0ba.fill-800x450.format-webp.webp","width":800,"height":450}},"featured_image_caption":"","featured_image_credit":"Rodrigo Melo (Picsum #32)","body":[{"type":"paragraph","value":"<p>The <b>Kochi Water Metro</b> will add four new routes and 15 electric boats by next year, officials said on Monday, extending the network to <a href=\"https://example.com\">three island communities</a> that today depend on private ferries.</p>","id":"c46bd306-b7d0-4ec4-b808-dea8cbad74b9"},{"type":"paragraph","value":"<p>Officials confirmed the details on Monday after a meeting that ran late into the evening. Residents said they had been waiting for clarity for several weeks, and local traders welcomed the announcement. Further steps are expected to be outlined later this week, with a review planned once the first phase is complete.</p>","id":"b3c8ebf1-1255-4be7-946e-dfe5f61037a9"},{"type":"paragraph","value":"<h2>What changes for commuters</h2><ul><li>Four new routes from Vyttila and High Court terminals</li><li>Boats every 15 minutes at peak hours</li><li>One card for metro rail and water metro</li></ul>","id":"c074418a-7bfc-4450-8302-04b5229ca82f"},{"type":"quote","value":{"text":"Every island in the city should be one short, clean ride from the mainland.","attribution":"Managing Director, Kochi Metro Rail"},"id":"6381c291-eea9-445d-98c0-253c52981fce"},{"type":"paragraph","value":"<p>Officials confirmed the details on Monday after a meeting that ran late into the evening. Residents said they had been waiting for clarity for several weeks, and local traders welcomed the announcement. Further steps are expected to be outlined later this week, with a review planned once the first phase is complete.</p>","id":"4709b865-98df-499c-b830-c247cc769f0c"},{"type":"image","value":{"image":{"id":66,"title":"Stock photo by Kelley Bozarth (Picsum #407)","alt":"Illustrative stock photo","width":1600,"height":900,"renditions":{"thumbnail":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-407.2e16d0ba.fill-400x225.format-webp.webp","width":400,"height":225},"card":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-407.2e16d0ba.fill-800x450.format-webp.webp","width":800,"height":450},"hero":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-407.2e16d0ba.fill-1600x900.format-webp.webp","width":1600,"height":900}}},"caption":"A water metro boat at the Vyttila terminal (illustrative photo).","credit":"Digital Truth News"},"id":"7e966f8f-3e68-4a5c-aff8-56da9c63a584"},{"type":"paragraph","value":"<p>Officials confirmed the details on Monday after a meeting that ran late into the evening. Residents said they had been waiting for clarity for several weeks, and local traders welcomed the announcement. Further steps are expected to be outlined later this week, with a review planned once the first phase is complete.</p>","id":"63f58704-191c-4ea6-a4cd-d18ff6cdd448"},{"type":"paragraph","value":"<h3>Fares and timings</h3><ol><li>Minimum fare stays at Rs 20</li><li>Weekly passes from Rs 180</li></ol><blockquote>Passes will be sold at every terminal from the first day.</blockquote>","id":"555aaba4-e54d-4624-a140-47d37f529a79"},{"type":"related_link","value":{"label":"Kochi Metro phase two completes first trial run","page":{"id":28,"title":"Kochi Metro phase two completes first trial run","type":"news.articlepage"},"url":"/kochi/kochi-metro-phase-two-trial-run","is_internal":true},"id":"c25e7f93-66a0-4e71-aaae-898bdaf88a92"},{"type":"paragraph","value":"<p>Officials confirmed the details on Monday after a meeting that ran late into the evening. Residents said they had been waiting for clarity for several weeks, and local traders welcomed the announcement. Further steps are expected to be outlined later this week, with a review planned once the first phase is complete.</p>","id":"9b5dcf32-62ca-473b-8a6a-442c2874f6b0"},{"type":"paragraph","value":"<p>Officials confirmed the details on Monday after a meeting that ran late into the evening. Residents said they had been waiting for clarity for several weeks, and local traders welcomed the announcement. Further steps are expected to be outlined later this week, with a review planned once the first phase is complete.</p>","id":"b43cdc26-1f38-4f19-9ed1-b2cbab4ebc70"}],"live_updates":[],"corrections":[{"id":2,"date":"2026-11-19T15:13:12.721244+05:30","text":"The name of the terminal at Vyttila was misspelt. It has been corrected.","is_major":false},{"id":1,"date":"2026-11-19T13:13:12.721244+05:30","text":"An earlier version said the new routes open in January. They open on 1 December.","is_major":true}],"reporter_profile":{"name":"Rahul Nair","slug":"rahul-nair","url":"/reporter/rahul-nair","designation":"Correspondent","beat":"Sports and Business, Kochi","bio":"Ra